<title>UK: Uruguay sets $300 million 30-year bond.</title>
<headline>Uruguay sets $300 million 30-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   URUGUAY</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     7.875     MATURITY    15.JUL.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.362    PAY DATE    15.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    99.362    SPREAD	+135 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA3	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BBB-	DENOMS (K) 100+1     SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  URUGUAY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    50 BP     SELL CONC  50 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.5 PCT NOVEMBER 2026 U.S. TREASURY BOND  NOTES	DEAL WAS FORMALLY LAUNCHED IN NEW YORK ON JULY 9</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
